            "text": "theorem graphDr_graphDz_comm {f : ℝ × E → ℝ} {k : ℝ → ℝ} (v w : E)\n    {p : ℝ × E} (hf : ContDiffAt ℝ 2 f p) (hk : DifferentiableAt ℝ k p.1) :\n    graphDr k v (graphDz w f) p = graphDz w (graphDr k v f) p"
